<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Examples of randomly generated CIFAR-10 images from <span id="A2.F4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Vanilla</span> models trained under different types of imprecise supervision.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F5" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
